{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/48554-self-promotion-my-short-story","id":48554,"title":"Self-Promotion: My Short Story!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-13T16:14:50-08:00","id":48554,"title":"Self-Promotion: My Short Story!","content":"Hey, folks! Aranis here. I wanted to make this thread to promote my new short story that I recently posted to the Kindle Store called Killing a Killer (link <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Killing-Killer-Aaron-Daniels-ebook/dp/B00HRLU7RQ/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1389657309&amp;sr=8-1&amp;keywords=killing+a+killer+aaron+daniels\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>).<br /> <br /> It's an epic fantasy story about a woman named Gerra who has been imbued with a magical energy centered on death and bloodshed. She hopes to turn away from it and find some normalcy again, but the rite designed to make it happen has a price steeper than she could have ever imagined ...<br /> <br /> The story is about 12 pages long. Thanks in advance for your patronage, should you choose to buy a copy! If you do, please let me know what you think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":42,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/42-aranis","user":"Aranis","date":". 01-13-2014, 07:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/42-aranis","name":"Aranis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar42_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T07:44:15-08:00","id":48954,"title":"","content":"As an update, I've lowered the price to $0.99.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/42-aranis","name":"Aranis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar42_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T10:34:10-08:00","id":49898,"title":"","content":"If you would write a review of this for me here -- it wouldn't have to be anything major -- then I would be glad to provide a you a free copy of my story! PM if you're interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/42-aranis","name":"Aranis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar42_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T23:36:03-08:00","id":64638,"title":"","content":"I discovered this on Tumblr, so I'll just quote what I said about it there...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Read it and liked it.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">It\u2019s a pretty simple story, but it feels like it\u2019s part of a bigger world. I could see it as the epilogue of a thousand-page novel. (You\u2019d have to edit out a few words of introduction, of course, but you get the point I\u2019m making here).</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Speaking of thousand-page novels, it has that sort of feel. You know the writing style I\u2019m talking about, the kind you get in stories about quasi-medieval settings full of magic? It\u2019s in that style. Mostly it works - there are some nice touches - but there are some bits that I find clunky.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Some real tension around the middle of the story, too.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Overall, I think this is easily worth the dollar it costs to buy and the fifteen minutes it takes to read. I\u2019m a little biased, but that\u2019s my honest opinion.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T09:51:03-08:00","id":64932,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the review, Sanctaphrax!<br /> <br /> There you have it, folks, Sanctaphrax says that it's totally worth your time and money. Therefore, you should spend both and buy and read it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/42-aranis","name":"Aranis